{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The person who made this game is a super coward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He likes games but cannot play horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So he made a horror game that he himself could play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He had no skill to make games, but he studied with AI and made a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is only about not looking back even if you see something scary, and just walking forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not be afraid. Even the super coward developer cleared this game. He became immune to horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is controlled only with mouse and W, A, S, D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playtime takes about 15\u201320 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be cleared even by a super coward. You must endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your courage is praised.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009900?t=1758868771","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009900?t=1758868771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009900/a2d24965a5bb25cff9486fed210ec98211514fe7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758868771","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009900/a2d24965a5bb25cff9486fed210ec98211514fe7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758868771","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The person who made this game is a super coward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He likes games but cannot play horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So he made a horror game that he himself could play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He had no skill to make games, but he studied with AI and made a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is only about not looking back even if you see something scary, and just walking forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not be afraid. Even the super coward developer cleared this game. He became immune to horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is controlled only with mouse and W, A, S, D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playtime takes about 15\u201320 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be cleared even by a super coward. You must endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your courage is praised.</p>","developers":["Spaced Out"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009900/f86cd742fe712afbf4a3d541929f5f3d5dfb0484/header.jpg?t=1758868771","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4009900/472392443/0deb68fa8b725e3aaa2e2b5dba4631dfb56226b9/1757287469/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757656057","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4009900/472392443/0deb68fa8b725e3aaa2e2b5dba4631dfb56226b9/1757287469/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757656057","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4009900/472392443/0deb68fa8b725e3aaa2e2b5dba4631dfb56226b9/1757287469/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757656057","id":257194372,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194372/movie480.mp4?t=1757656057","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194372/movie_max.mp4?t=1757656057"},"name":"Don't look back trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257